'''Lusamine''' (Japanese: '''ルザミーネ''' ''Lusamine'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=You can use this card only if your opponent has gotten at least 1 point.

Choose 1 of your {{TCGP|Ultra Beast}}s. Attach 2 random Energy from your discard pile to that Pokémon.
}}

