==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Lusamine}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Lusamine]] is the head of the [[Aether Foundation]]. The interior of [[Aether Paradise]] is featured in the standard illustration. The merged form of Lusamine with {{p|Nihilego}} is featured in the {{TCGP|Deluxe Pack: ex}} Super rare card's illustration.

